💡 Most Used in DevOps

1. Deploy to multiple servers     → for server in servers
2. Check all containers/pods      → for container in containers
3. Process all log files          → for file in log_files
4. Backup multiple files to S3    → for file in files
5. Run multiple commands          → for cmd in commands
6. Check all EC2 instances        → for instance in instances
7. Retry failed deployments       → for attempt in range(3)
8. Walk through directories       → os.walk()


